<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear Customer,</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">As part of the upcoming migration of your Volvo Repair &amp; Maintenance (R&amp;M) contracts from Volvo Financial Services Limited (VFS) to Volvo Group UK Limited (VGUK), we would like to inform you that we are now unable to process any changes to your existing contracts.</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Your request will be forwarded to VGUK, who will follow up with you within the next few weeks.<strong> If you have any queries regarding your request or the follow-up process, please contact VGUK via email at contractadmin.uk-ie@volvo.com.</strong></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Please note, it is important that you do not cancel your existing direct debit mandates with VFS. VFS will continue to administer your current R&amp;M contracts until the migration is complete.&nbsp;</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">For any other questions related to your contract, please reach out to VFS via phone on +44 1926 401 203 or email at vfs.customerservice.ie@volvo.com.</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We appreciate your understanding during this transition.</span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Yours faithfully,</span></p>
</body>
</html>